> Separate numerical fidelity from model quality

A separate development NumPy oracle checks719283 forward values,34986 analytic
partials,13 scalar finite differences, all96 Adam writes and3000 fitting-row
visits. It checks4096 causal Jacobian entries,64 future-flip guards and5376
sampled pixels across epoch snapshots, final samples and completions. All80
forbidden input weights remain bit identical and their partials are exactly zero.
The report must reproduce all22 original archives/2028400 values and288 training
captures before the old executable is retired. Data preparation and runtime use
the native API, without a TensorFlow dependency or another checkout.

This is a faithful compact Row-LSTM density experiment. Its fixed-final loss
remains worse than the fit-only baseline. The linked zero state, gate order,
forget offset, row recurrence and causal sampling protocol are verified; the
results do not claim classification accuracy, perceptual realism, full-paper
PixelRNN performance or evidence that every past pixel influences every logit.

